## Interface: 16001
## Title: Scrollkeeper
## Notes: Mage scrolls made easy: what you can decipher, one-button deciphering, Study timer, and tooltips for every class.
## Author: generalwrex
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: ScrollkeeperDB, ScrollkeeperScan
## Category: Class

# Core: shared helpers every other file uses. Load these first.
Core\Init.lua
Core\Constants.lua

# Data: plain tables of game facts. Edit these when Blizzard changes scrolls.
Data\Scrolls.lua

# Modules: one feature per file. None of them draw anything.
Modules\Skill.lua
Modules\Bags.lua
Modules\Study.lua
Modules\Decipher.lua
Modules\Tooltip.lua

# UI: everything you can see.
UI\Panel.lua

# Slash commands.
Commands.lua

# Dev: data collection tool used while building the addon (/sk scan).
Dev\Scan.lua
